  <article class="docs-body">
    
    <h1>API</h1>
    <p class="lede">the API is available to everyone.</p>
    <p>license: <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/" rel="nofollow noopener">ODbL 1.0</a></p>
<h2 id="usage">usage</h2>
<p><a href="https://api.adsb.lol" rel="nofollow noopener">https://api.adsb.lol</a> — the interactive docs and schema are at <a href="https://api.adsb.lol/docs" rel="nofollow noopener">/docs</a>.</p>
<p>send your key as <code>x-api-key: &lt;key&gt;</code>.</p>
<h2 id="limits">limits</h2>
<p>no key: <strong>500 requests/day per IP</strong>. a free key raises that:</p>
<ul>
<li>anonymous (30 days, no account): 500/day</li>
<li>adhoc (free, <a href="/request">request form</a>): 1,000/day</li>
<li>feeder (free, by <a href="/docs/get-started/introduction">feeding the network</a>):</li>
</ul>
<p>7,200/day, 20 GB/month, and the raw <a href="/docs/feeders-only/re-api">re-api</a></p>
<ul>
<li>sponsor plans: up to 360,000/day — full table at <a href="/sponsor">sponsor</a></li>
</ul>
<p>over quota returns <code>429</code> with <code>Retry-After</code>; the daily window resets at 00:00 UTC.</p>
<p><strong>get a key:</strong> <a href="https://www.adsb.lol/mmb" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.adsb.lol/mmb</a></p>

    
  </article>
